{% comment %}
  Step 4 (shown as "Step 3 of 5") — pick a day and time slot.

  MOBILE REDESIGN per a later Figma pass (node 438:7388), same instruction
  as Doctor Select: stay with the design, ignore backend integration.
  - Header swapped to the shared kal-booking-flow-step-header.liquid
    snippet (back/facility badge/close + step progress bar), replacing
    the old dots-only header.
  - The doctor summary line is now a richer static "appointment card"
    (photo, "YOUR CONSULTATION" eyebrow, name, mode + price) — deliberately
    NOT reusing .kal-doctor-summary — this is new, separate markup/CSS
    (.kal-appointment-card*). Confirmation used to share .kal-doctor-summary
    too but dropped it entirely in its own later redesign pass (see that
    step's own liquid comment), so as of that pass nothing references
    .kal-doctor-summary anymore.
  - The day strip is now fully static (5 hardcoded day cards matching the
    Figma example exactly — Today/Mon/Tue/Wed/Thu with their own slot
    counts and colors), not client-generated from today's real date via
    STRIP_DAYS/generateMockDaySummaries. Clicking a card still updates
    slotPicker.selectedDate (via a real day-offset from today), just
    without any per-day fetch or badge computation.
  - "Available time" is now a Morning/Afternoon/Evening TAB bar (only one
    panel visible at a time) instead of three stacked labeled sections.
    Each panel's time buttons are static markup (Morning matches the
    Figma grid exactly, with 10:30 AM pre-selected; Afternoon/Evening are
    reasonable static fills — Figma's own export only showed the Morning
    tab's content). Kept as plain .kal-slot-chip buttons with the same
    data-kal-slot-start/-end attributes the existing click handler and
    Confirmation-summary formatting already expect, so slot selection
    still works with no JS rewrite needed for that part.
  - The calendar icon next to "CHOOSE A SLOT" is decorative only now (no
    data-kal-open-calendar) — the calendar MODAL flow doesn't fit a fully
    static day strip. The calendar modal this used to share with Therapy
    Slot's old date picker is gone entirely now — that screen was
    replaced by a therapy-category checkbox list in its own later flow
    change (node 539:2128, see that step's own liquid comment), so
    nothing opens the modal anymore and it (kal-booking-flow.liquid's
    kal-calendar-modal, its CSS, and its JS) was removed rather than left
    dead.
  - Continue is now a plain always-enabled button (a slot is already
    selected by default, matching the Figma screenshot), not a
    disabled-until-selected button with dynamic "Continue with <date>"
    text — see kal-booking-flow.js's own comment on this.

  Doctor id/facility id are still placeholders (data-kal-doctor-id/
  data-kal-facility-id on the wrapper below) — unaffected by this pass,
  harmless to leave for whenever real backend wiring resumes, even though
  nothing here calls them today since the day-strip/slot-grid are static.

  Single shared markup, not a __mobile + __desktop split — see the "SHARED
  STEP SHELL" comment in kal-booking-flow.css for why and how the layout
  switches at 750px. Left column reuses .kal-step-entry__info, same as the
  other steps; this pass is mobile-only, so that copy is left as-is.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-slot-picker kal-step-shell" data-kal-doctor-id="2a3340b9-79d2-4d50-ba28-817f61ce327e" data-kal-facility-id="bfa7bd70-428b-4fd3-80c3-2c7f0106497d">

  <div class="kal-step-entry__info kal-step-shell__info">
    <div class="kal-step-entry__info-content">
      <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading">Pick your visit</h2>
      <p class="kal-step-entry__body-text">
        Book a consultation in under a minute in-clinic or video. Confirmation
        arrives instantly, no account required.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="kal-step-entry__location">
      <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
        <!-- ICON: location-pin (not received yet) -->
      </span>
      <span class="kal-step-entry__location-text">
        Kerala Ayurveda Wellness Center, Indiranagar &middot; Opens 8 AM
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kal-step-shell__panel">

    {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-step-header', back_target: 'doctor-select', step_number: 3, step_total: 5, next_label: 'Personal details' -%}

    <div class="kal-step-shell__scroll">
      <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__intro">
        <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Choose a date &amp; time</h2>
      </div>

      {%- assign appointment_photo_url = 'kal-doctor-photo-placeholder.jpg' | asset_url -%}
      {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-appointment-card', photo_url: appointment_photo_url, name: 'Dr. Neethu Jayachandran', price: '&#8377;500' -%}

      <div class="kal-slot-section">
        <div class="kal-slot-section__head">
          <p class="kal-slot-section__label">Choose a Slot</p>
          <button type="button" class="kal-icon-button kal-icon-button--round" aria-label="Open calendar">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'calendar-month' -%}
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kal-day-strip">
          <button type="button" class="kal-day-chip kal-day-chip--active" data-kal-slot-day-offset="0">
            <span class="kal-day-chip__label">Today</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__date">6</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__badge kal-day-chip__badge--high">5 slots</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="kal-day-chip" data-kal-slot-day-offset="1">
            <span class="kal-day-chip__label">Mon</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__date">7</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__badge kal-day-chip__badge--high">4 slots</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="kal-day-chip" data-kal-slot-day-offset="2">
            <span class="kal-day-chip__label">Tue</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__date">8</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__badge kal-day-chip__badge--high">3 slots</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="kal-day-chip" data-kal-slot-day-offset="3" disabled>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__label">Wed</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__date">9</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__badge kal-day-chip__badge--none">0 slots</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="kal-day-chip" data-kal-slot-day-offset="4">
            <span class="kal-day-chip__label">Thu</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__date">10</span>
            <span class="kal-day-chip__badge kal-day-chip__badge--busy">5 slots</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-slot-tabs">
        <div class="kal-slot-tabs__bar">
          <button type="button" class="kal-slot-tab kal-slot-tab--active" data-kal-slot-tab="morning">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'period-morning' -%}
            MORNING
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="kal-slot-tab" data-kal-slot-tab="afternoon">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'period-afternoon' -%}
            AFTERNOON
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="kal-slot-tab" data-kal-slot-tab="evening">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'period-evening' -%}
            EVENING
          </button>
        </div>

        <div data-kal-slot-periods>
          <div class="kal-slot-grid" data-kal-slot-panel="morning">
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="09:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="09:45:00">9:00 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="09:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="10:15:00">9:30 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="09:45:00" data-kal-slot-end="10:30:00">9:45 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="10:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="10:45:00">10:00 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="10:15:00" data-kal-slot-end="11:00:00">10:15 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip kal-slot-chip--active" data-kal-slot-start="10:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="11:15:00">10:30 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="11:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="11:45:00">11:00 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="11:15:00" data-kal-slot-end="12:00:00">11:15 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="11:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="12:15:00">11:30 AM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="11:45:00" data-kal-slot-end="12:30:00">11:45 AM</button>
          </div>
          <div class="kal-slot-grid" data-kal-slot-panel="afternoon" hidden>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="12:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="12:45:00">12:00 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="12:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="13:15:00">12:30 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="13:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="13:45:00">1:00 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="13:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="14:15:00">1:30 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="14:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="14:45:00">2:00 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="14:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="15:15:00">2:30 PM</button>
          </div>
          <div class="kal-slot-grid" data-kal-slot-panel="evening" hidden>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="16:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="16:45:00">4:00 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="16:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="17:15:00">4:30 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="17:00:00" data-kal-slot-end="17:45:00">5:00 PM</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-slot-chip" data-kal-slot-start="17:30:00" data-kal-slot-end="18:15:00">5:30 PM</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-shell__footer">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-goto="patient-details">
        Continue
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>
